---
import '../styles/global.css';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
---

<html lang="en">
<head>
  <title>About Phil Lyons</title>
</head>
<body>
  <Header />
  <main class="page">
    <section class="about">
      <div class="portrait">
        <img src="/images/phil.png" alt="Phil Lyons" />
      </div>
      <div class="copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
        <h1>Experience, curiosity and a genuine interest in people.</h1>
        <p>
          I create photography and film for organisations that need to communicate clearly. Whether it is engineering, manufacturing, technology, people or products, the goal is always the same: create imagery that tells a story and connects with an audience.
        </p>
        <p>
          After many years working with businesses and brands, I understand that the best images are not just about cameras and lighting. They are about understanding what matters to an organisation and finding the visual story within it.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</body>
</html>

<style>
.page { padding-top: 10rem; }
.about { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1.2fr; gap:5rem; align-items:center; }
.portrait img { width:100%; aspect-ratio:3/4; object-fit:cover; }
.eyebrow { text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.15em; }
h1 { font-size:clamp(2.5rem,5vw,5rem); }
p { font-size:1.15rem; max-width:700px; }
@media(max-width:800px){.about{display:block}.copy{margin-top:2rem}}
</style>
